factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the shops are set up in front of the Municipal Corporation office (மாநகராட்சி அலுவலகம் அருகிலேயே), but the draft's reel_script never mentions this; the slides mention it while the reel omits it — minor, but the reel_script is missing this important location fact.
  The reel_script says the municipality spent crores on the footpath, but the article says the Corporation spent crores (பல கோடி ரூபாய் மாநகராட்சி செலவழித்தது) on a footpath funded by Smart City — the draft attributes the spending to the municipality while also attributing funding to Smart City; this is consistent, so not a problem. However, the reel_script says 'பொருட்களைப் பறிமுதல் செய்ய' (confiscate goods) while the article says 'அவற்றை பறிமுதல் செய்ய' — consistent.
  The reel_script says 'பேருந்துகள் நிற்கும் நேரத்தில் பெண்கள் கடந்து செல்ல சிரமப்படுகின்றனர்' — the article says the women struggle to pass when buses stop; this is consistent.
  The reel_script states that 'இதனால் பயணிகள் நிற்கவும் இருக்கையில் அமரவும்' — the article says there is insufficient space for passengers to stand and sit; this is consistent.
  The caption's sentence 'பயணிகள் நிற்கவும் அமரவும் இடமில்லை. பாதசாரிகள் செல்ல வழியில்லாததால்...' — the 'as a result' link is a causal claim the article does not explicitly make; the article only states the lack of space and that people squeeze through or walk on the road, which is not the same as a stated cause.
